docs(api): document release_version on /v1/health

The backend sends release_version on every /v1/health response but the
OpenAPI schema and the README prose/table omitted it, so a client reading
the reference would never learn the field exists. Adds the property to the
HealthResponse schema and updates the endpoint row + response example,
with the same env-var-not-proof caveat the client type carries.

Closes #599.

The commit-time parity gate added by #587 checks schema NAMES against
types.ts (HealthResponse exists on both sides), so this property-level
drift passed it — a property-level comparison is the follow-up class.
